    C --> G["Simetría<br/>d(x,y)=d(y,x)"]
    C --> H["Desigualdad triangular<br/>d(x,z) ≤ d(x,y)+d(y,z)"]
    D --> I["Identifica el axioma violado"]
    I --> J["Corrige o descarta la candidata"]
